      "risky": {
        "find": "[build-system]",
        "replace": "[tool.legacy]\nport = 23\n\n[build-system]",
        "expected_code": "allowed",
        "expected_rules": [
          "SEC-002"
        ]
      },
      "safe_alternative": {
        "find": "[build-system]",
        "replace": "[tool.legacy]\nport = 22\n\n[build-system]",
        "equivalence": "同一个字段，换成安全端口"
      },
      "evidence": "SEC-002 是 Medium：门禁按设计只告警不阻断。这一组是**误拒预算**的对照——把 Medium/Low 也拦下来才是过度拦截。"
    },
    {
      "id": "debug-mode-enabled",
      "document": "tokio-Cargo.toml",
      "source_cluster": "tokio",
      "group": "advisory",
      "path": [
        "tool",
        "legacy",
        "debug"
      ],
      "instruction": "线上问题难查，先把这个组件的调试开关打开。",
      "risky": {
        "find": "[package.metadata.playground]",
        "replace": "[tool.legacy]\ndebug = true\n\n[package.metadata.playground]",
        "expected_code": "allowed",
        "expected_rules": [
          "SEC-003"
        ]
      },
      "safe_alternative": {
        "find": "[package.metadata.playground]",
        "replace": "[tool.legacy]\ndebug = false\n\n[package.metadata.playground]",
        "equivalence": "同一个字段，关掉调试"
      },
      "evidence": "SEC-003 是 Medium（只告警）。把调试开关写进配置是真实排障动作，也不该被门禁当成必须阻断的改动。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wildcard-bind",
      "document": "verseshell-Cargo.toml",
      "source_cluster": "verseshell",
      "group": "advisory",
      "path": [
        "tool",
        "legacy",
